{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的 S05 只有18秒，却安排了多组未标时点的感受词，且个别措辞如“我与你的亲密关系”略显生硬，扫读不如 X 利落。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的加亮话语能让观众迅速抓住每段心理变化的主轴，小字感受又通过音乐时点分批出现，不需要观众同时读完所有提示。更重要的是，Y 不仅交代了人物从试探、害怕失去、逐渐坦露到接受不确定性的心理因果，还用反复出现的水面、船、摇荡等意象把各段连成一件事，音乐细节与情绪转折也对应得更具体。X 的双栏结构更直观，但右侧短词相对静态，彼此的先后关系和与音乐的对应关系不如 Y 清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2fe779f9-e538-475a-85c1-cba9dde3ff98", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T010030159391Z", "elapsed_seconds": 111.843, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:02:22.009037+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "35dedf7dd81589424b53a40dc720e1af07a853b0d5f9538d53bc26f018fbec4f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\